{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320320001:1":{"text":"Chippy can't help but notice that the frame of this painting is super wobbly, and the canvas has some bumps, making it look kinda dirty!","source_cn":"满满之前就想说了，这幅画的画框摔断了好几处！画布也不平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39566573C86CBAF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"Torn Painting","source_cn":"残破的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF773940056FD220C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320320002:1":{"text":"Chippy, look more closely...","source_cn":"……满满，你再仔细看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645301ADBAD5D950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320320003:1":{"text":"The canvas has already been smoothed out; what you see are just stains!","source_cn":"——画布早就被整理平整了，那些就是脏污呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4624992E5B4BE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320320004:0":{"text":"Aside from that, the most severe problem is the wear on the painting, especially around the torn edges.","source_cn":"除了这些，最严重的是画面磨损。尤其是在被撕裂的裂口两边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86201EA840EBBD1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320320005:1":{"text":"Like I said earlier, we need some special paint to fix this painting. It should have better coverage than the ones sold by the Black Crow Trader.","source_cn":"正如我刚才所说，想要修复这幅画，需要一些特殊的颜料。至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3304613D879300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320320006:1":{"text":"As for the frame... it deserves sturdier wood.","source_cn":"至于画框……我想，它配得上更耐用的木材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B7A4F27885989F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320320007:1":{"text":"Where can we find those materials?","source_cn":"那我们该上哪找这些材料呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C79D664D4ED84C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320320008:1":{"text":"The Duskmire Forest has the right kind of wood. I can make the paint myself, but I need the <style=\"highlight\">dust from the wings of the oculus bats</style>.","source_cn":"黑沼森林里就有合适的木材。颜料我可以自行制作，但需要<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8DB3A0CD315C615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","doc